    "name": "Arcane Tower Survivors",
    "steam_appid": 2433850,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/5b9f498430d18d3e833a355ce720ef64.poster.avif?t=1754889109\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/5b9f498430d18d3e833a355ce720ef64.webm?t=1754889109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/5b9f498430d18d3e833a355ce720ef64.mp4?t=1754889109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcane Tower Survivors is a horde survival game where you face relentless waves of enemies in intense 20-minute sessions, with over 100 unique skills to help you fend off the onslaught. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>Make different builds that are unique each game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/79c4eeca2de2002fbeb55a1eeab26931.poster.avif?t=1754889109\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/79c4eeca2de2002fbeb55a1eeab26931.webm?t=1754889109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/79c4eeca2de2002fbeb55a1eeab26931.mp4?t=1754889109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Rebuild abandoned wizard tower to get more abilities, characters and weapons.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/7f00ee66dafa0804a8ef1727ae62010d.poster.avif?t=1754889109\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/7f00ee66dafa0804a8ef1727ae62010d.webm?t=1754889109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/7f00ee66dafa0804a8ef1727ae62010d.mp4?t=1754889109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extensive Skill System</strong>: Discover and master more than 100 character skills, allowing for limitless build combinations and strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Heroes and Weapons</strong>: Choose from a wide array of heroes and weaponry, each offering unique abilities and playstyles to keep each run fresh and exciting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Tower Management</strong>: Engage in a deep meta-game between battles. Build and upgrade your tower to gain passive bonuses, unlock new content, and strengthen your characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Sessions</strong>: Experience intense action in 20-minute runs designed for quick yet satisfying gameplay sessions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Enhancement</strong>: Benefit from a passive progression system where each run contributes to your overall power, encouraging continual growth and new tactical opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/fd62b61938fd9a9c456e56f8f713f8e7.poster.avif?t=1754889109\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/fd62b61938fd9a9c456e56f8f713f8e7.webm?t=1754889109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/fd62b61938fd9a9c456e56f8f713f8e7.mp4?t=1754889109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight engaging bosses that will keep you on your toes and offer great rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/3491bfd3b2d7519f242590014449be04.poster.avif?t=1754889109\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/3491bfd3b2d7519f242590014449be04.webm?t=1754889109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/3491bfd3b2d7519f242590014449be04.mp4?t=1754889109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/5b9f498430d18d3e833a355ce720ef64.poster.avif?t=1754889109\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/5b9f498430d18d3e833a355ce720ef64.webm?t=1754889109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/5b9f498430d18d3e833a355ce720ef64.mp4?t=1754889109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcane Tower Survivors is a horde survival game where you face relentless waves of enemies in intense 20-minute sessions, with over 100 unique skills to help you fend off the onslaught. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>Make different builds that are unique each game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/79c4eeca2de2002fbeb55a1eeab26931.poster.avif?t=1754889109\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/79c4eeca2de2002fbeb55a1eeab26931.webm?t=1754889109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/79c4eeca2de2002fbeb55a1eeab26931.mp4?t=1754889109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Rebuild abandoned wizard tower to get more abilities, characters and weapons.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/7f00ee66dafa0804a8ef1727ae62010d.poster.avif?t=1754889109\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/7f00ee66dafa0804a8ef1727ae62010d.webm?t=1754889109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/7f00ee66dafa0804a8ef1727ae62010d.mp4?t=1754889109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extensive Skill System</strong>: Discover and master more than 100 character skills, allowing for limitless build combinations and strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Heroes and Weapons</strong>: Choose from a wide array of heroes and weaponry, each offering unique abilities and playstyles to keep each run fresh and exciting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Tower Management</strong>: Engage in a deep meta-game between battles. Build and upgrade your tower to gain passive bonuses, unlock new content, and strengthen your characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Sessions</strong>: Experience intense action in 20-minute runs designed for quick yet satisfying gameplay sessions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Enhancement</strong>: Benefit from a passive progression system where each run contributes to your overall power, encouraging continual growth and new tactical opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/fd62b61938fd9a9c456e56f8f713f8e7.poster.avif?t=1754889109\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/fd62b61938fd9a9c456e56f8f713f8e7.webm?t=1754889109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/fd62b61938fd9a9c456e56f8f713f8e7.mp4?t=1754889109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight engaging bosses that will keep you on your toes and offer great rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/3491bfd3b2d7519f242590014449be04.poster.avif?t=1754889109\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/3491bfd3b2d7519f242590014449be04.webm?t=1754889109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/3491bfd3b2d7519f242590014449be04.mp4?t=1754889109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
